      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, would your suggestion be to drop this comment?\n\nThe reason why I have kept it so far is because `vdexInstalls` contains files for primary and secondary arches, but not one for the \"no-arch\" location.\ne.g.\n```\n#image.vdexInstalls\nout/soong/dexpreopt_arm64/dex_bootjars/android/system/framework/arm/boot.vdex\nout/soong/dexpreopt_arm64/dex_bootjars/android/system/framework/arm64/boot.vdex\n```\n\nI wanted this comment to indicate that `out/soong/dexpreopt_arm64/dex_bootjars/android/system/framework/arm64/boot.vdex` gets installed at `out/soong/dexpreopt_arm64/dex_bootjars/android/system/framework/boot.vdex` (the root of the `framework` directory)",
      "parentUuid": "2f379c07_38bd279a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 954,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 955,
        "endChar": 53
      },
